FILE     fbrotd.nc (from line 1)
DIALECT  series a 0 6 10 15 16 0i 30i (nothing series-specific used)
NOTE     G0 with Z and X/Y: the DX32 moves Z first up or last down, FANUC all at once
NOTE     drilling cycles are written out as moves; cycle values in D27 D28 D29 D30 D31
NOTE     G68/G69/G52 written as G73 A (rotation about X0 Y0), G72 and G97 (fixture offset): a rotation about (cx,cy) is G73 plus an offset of c - R c; the G52 shift is added to it
NOTE     the output needs BOSS 4-7 compatibility mode off
WROTE    fbwrotd.txt
CHECK    dxsim reads fbwrotd.txt cleanly and reaches all 9 FANUC end points in order
RESULT   ok
